    "turn_idx": 131,
    "turn_text": "Right. All right. Let's talk about Elizabeth Warren. Senator Warren on the show today. I have to say, I don't think there's a better political guess that you can have than Senator Elizabeth Warren. She is so sharp and interesting. She said something interesting today that I think was newsworthy. She said the Democrats' first priority would be to suspend the filibuster and to codify Roe versus Wade. if Democrats win the White House House and Senate. Does that give you hope? They have to win all three. They do, but maybe that's a motivator.",
